  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/3f72bcc9345251ea9e512d8b7a66e194d341f01f" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.671ex; width:12.536ex; height:2.843ex;" alt="{\displaystyle \operatorname {id} \to g'_{*}\circ g'^{*}}"/></span></dd></dl>
<p id="mwYg">and so</p>

<dl id="mwYw"><dd id="mwZA"><span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt36" id="mwZQ" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"R^r f_* \\to R^r f_* \\circ g&apos;_* \\circ g&apos;^*."}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle R^{r}f_{*}\to R^{r}f_{*}\circ g'_{*}\circ g'^{*}.}">
