<p id="mwmg">and so for <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt55" id="mwmw" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"s = g(t)"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle s=g(t)}">
