<p id="mwyA">To obtain a base-change result, the functor <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt72" id="mwyQ" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"f_*"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle f_{*}}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <msub>
          <mi>f</mi>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mo>∗<!-- ∗ --></mo>
          </mrow>
        </msub>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle f_{*}}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/903e97c260c5d157bff320b5e38e0e4b42cd20ad" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.671ex; width:2.193ex; height:2.509ex;" alt="{\displaystyle f_{*}}"/></span> (or its derived functor) has to be replaced by the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Direct_image_with_compact_support" title="Direct image with compact support" id="mwyg">direct image with compact support</a> <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt73" id="mwyw" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"Rf_!"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle Rf_{!}}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mi>R</mi>
        <msub>
          <mi>f</mi>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mo>!</mo>
          </mrow>
        </msub>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle Rf_{!}}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/4702693d9d238e0e1ac5b876a6af273711c82874" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.671ex; width:3.593ex; height:2.509ex;" alt="{\displaystyle Rf_{!}}"/></span>. For example, if <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt74" id="mwzA" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"f: X \\to S"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle f:X\to S}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mi>f</mi>
        <mo>:</mo>
        <mi>X</mi>
        <mo stretchy="false">→<!-- → --></mo>
        <mi>S</mi>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle f:X\to S}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/a21a941b35354b73f5a62849067deac7ee9794dc" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.671ex; width:10.309ex; height:2.509ex;" alt="{\displaystyle f:X\to S}"/></span> is the inclusion of an open subset, such as in the above example, <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt75" id="mwzQ" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"Rf_! \\mathcal F"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle Rf_{!}{\mathcal {F}}}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
