</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/6cbb3f61c970ca4bc3724776b7a43324db54f814" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -2.505ex; width:25.48ex; height:6.176ex;" alt="{\displaystyle (Rf_{!}{\mathcal {F}})_{s}={\begin{cases}{\mathcal {F}}_{s}&amp;s\in X,\\0&amp;s\notin X.\end{cases}}}"/></span></dd></dl>

<p id="mw0Q">In general, there is a map <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt77" id="mw0g" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"Rf_! \\mathcal F \\to Rf_* \\mathcal F"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle Rf_{!}{\mathcal {F}}\to Rf_{*}{\mathcal {F}}}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
