</section></section><section data-mw-section-id="6" id="mw2w" aria-labelledby="Base_change_for_quasi-coherent_sheaves"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="Base_change_for_quasi-coherent_sheaves">Base change for quasi-coherent sheaves</h2><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Base_change_theorems&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6" title="Edit section: Base change for quasi-coherent sheaves"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>

<section data-mw-section-id="7" id="mw3A" aria-labelledby="Proper_base_change_2"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading3"><h3 id="Proper_base_change_2">Proper base change</h3><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Base_change_theorems&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7" title="Edit section: Proper base change"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p id="mw3Q"><i id="mw3g">Proper base change theorems</i> for <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Quasi-coherent_sheaf" title="Quasi-coherent sheaf" class="mw-redirect" id="mw3w">quasi-coherent sheaves</a> apply in the following situation: <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt81" id="mw4A" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"f: X \\to S"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle f:X\to S}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mi>f</mi>
        <mo>:</mo>
        <mi>X</mi>
        <mo stretchy="false">→<!-- → --></mo>
        <mi>S</mi>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle f:X\to S}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/a21a941b35354b73f5a62849067deac7ee9794dc" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.671ex; width:10.309ex; height:2.509ex;" alt="{\displaystyle f:X\to S}"/></span> is a <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Proper_morphism" title="Proper morphism" id="mw4Q">proper morphism</a> between <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Noetherian_scheme" title="Noetherian scheme" id="mw4g">noetherian schemes</a>, and <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt82" id="mw4w" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"\\mathcal{F}"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle {\mathcal {F}}}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mi class="MJX-tex-caligraphic" mathvariant="script">F</mi>
          </mrow>
        </mrow>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle {\mathcal {F}}}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/205d4b91000d9dcf1a5bbabdfa6a8395fa60b676" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.338ex; width:1.927ex; height:2.176ex;" alt="{\displaystyle {\mathcal {F}}}"/></span> is a <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Coherent_sheaf" title="Coherent sheaf" id="mw5A">coherent sheaf</a> which is <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Flat_morphism" title="Flat morphism" id="mw5Q">flat</a> over <i id="mw5g">S</i> (i.e., <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt83" id="mw5w" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"\\mathcal F_x"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle {\mathcal {F}}_{x}}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <msub>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
              <mi class="MJX-tex-caligraphic" mathvariant="script">F</mi>
            </mrow>
          </mrow>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mi>x</mi>
          </mrow>
        </msub>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle {\mathcal {F}}_{x}}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/66d72460f7036cb595f6158fd0e9e125a595cf2a" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.671ex; width:2.844ex; height:2.509ex;" alt="{\displaystyle {\mathcal {F}}_{x}}"/></span> is <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Flat_module" title="Flat module" id="mw6A">flat</a> over <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt84" id="mw6Q" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"\\mathcal O_{S, f(x)}"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle {\mathcal {O}}_{S,f(x)}}">
  <semantics>
