<p id="mwARw">As the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stalk_(mathematics)" title="Stalk (mathematics)" class="mw-redirect" id="mwAR0">stalk</a> of the sheaf <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt104" id="mwAR4" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"R^p f_* \\mathcal F"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle R^{p}f_{*}{\mathcal {F}}}">
