<p id="mwASQ">These statements are proved using the following fact, where in addition to the above assumptions <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt107" id="mwASU" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"S = \\operatorname{Spec} A"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle S=\operatorname {Spec} A}">
