</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/112d41fcf3492bbd2027b56fed7f4d7cfbfd77ca" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.838ex; width:3.69ex; height:2.676ex;" alt="{\displaystyle {\mathcal {O}}_{S'}}"/></span> has finite flat amplitude relative to <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt156" id="mwAXw" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"g"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle g}">
